{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Hq5LdPenWujvxNriRKTY5J","type":"tool_result","content":"| Plan | Monthly price | Included credits/month | Pay-as-you-go rate |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Researcher | Free | 1,000 | N/A |\n| Pay As You Go | Not listed | Not listed | $0.008 per credit |\n| Project | $30 | 4,000 | N/A |\n| Enterprise | Custom | Custom | Custom |\n\n- **Researcher:** Free, with no credit card required.\n- **Project:** Built for enthusiasts, with higher rate limits.\n- **Enterprise:** Custom API calls and rate limits, plus enterprise-grade support and SLAs.\n\nThe page does not state how many credits a basic search or an advanced search costs. It says credit usage depends on the request type and points to the documentation for full details."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8ead43dc-e126-44a6-9599-f25579e32d50","uuid":"76dd864c-d815-4dec-b67f-09faeb26c7ca","timestamp":"2026-10-17T17:49:30.868Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":77286,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"| Plan | Monthly price | Included credits/month | Pay-as-you-go rate |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Researcher | Free | 1,000 | N/A |\n| Pay As You Go | Not listed | Not listed | $0.008 per credit |\n| Project | $30 | 4,000 | N/A |\n| Enterprise | Custom | Custom | Custom |\n\n- **Researcher:** Free, with no credit card required.\n- **Project:** Built for enthusiasts, with higher rate limits.\n- **Enterprise:** Custom API calls and rate limits, plus enterprise-grade support and SLAs.\n\nThe page does not state how many credits a basic search or an advanced search costs. It says credit usage depends on the request type and points to the documentation for full details.","durationMs":4492,"url":"https://www.tavily.com/pricing"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Hq5LdPenWujvxNriRKTY5J","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
