{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg8EP6jHT2jnn8B3GsR2D","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"For about 15k searches a month, pay-as-you-go is the simplest fit, at roughly $120 a month. That figure assumes basic searches at 1 credit each, which I haven't confirmed.\n\nTavily's pricing page (tavily.com/pricing) lists these plans:\n\n| Plan | Price | Credits/month |\n|---|---|---|\n| Researcher | Free | 1,000 |\n| Project | $30/month | 4,000 |\n| Pay As You Go | $0.008 per credit | No monthly allotment |\n| Enterprise | Custom | Custom |\n\n- **Pay As You Go:** 15,000 credits × $0.008 comes to about **$120/month**. That holds if each search costs 1 credit.\n- **Project:** The $30 plan stops at 4,000 credits, so it doesn't cover 15k on its own. The page doesn't say whether you can buy extra credits on top. Check that before counting on it.\n- **Advanced searches:** The page doesn't state credits per search. From memory of Tavily's docs, a basic search is 1 credit and an advanced search is 2. If you need advanced search, 15k searches would use 30,000 credits, about $240/month at the pay-as-you-go rate.\n- **Enterprise:** Worth asking about only if you expect to grow well beyond this volume. Pricing is custom.\n\nThe page showed no mid-size plan between Project and Enterprise. Tavily has changed its tiers before, so check the dashboard or docs for the current credit costs per search type.\n\nSources: [Tavily pricing](https://www.tavily.com/pricing)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":416,"cache_read_input_tokens":19015,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":416},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8ead43